Version 2.3.2 brings one single change

Bugfix
- At certain UI scale factors (notable 1.00 and 1.01), redrawing
  a knob upon a parameter change would chop off the very top of the
  parameter name text below the knob. This has been corrected.

As usual, a companion version 2.3.2z has been tagged on the Zynthian branch,
which supports the graphic envelope and filter display features in the Zynthian
UI.
